# Keep Docker's build context small and, more importantly, keep local secrets
# and machine-specific state out of image layers.
.git
.github
.env*
!.env.example
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.coverage
**/coverage-html
frontend/dist
contract/cache
contract/artifacts
model/artifacts
model/data
model/notebooks
deploy/gcp/evidence
*.docx
